```console
$ scherzo-cloud run input --help
Manage retained run inputs

Usage: scherzo-cloud run input [COMMAND]

Commands:
  delete    Delete retained input content and schedule cleanup
  download  Download and verify retained input members
  show      Show the retained input inventory for a run
  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

```
